  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "This release restores the complete IKVM11 runtime on Intel and Apple Silicon Macs and fixes native Java AWT initialization for embedded ImageJ dialogs. Includes IKVM.Java.dll, IKVM.Runtime.dll, and IKVM.CoreLib.dll for .NET 6 and .NET 8 or later on macOS. Bundles the corrected AWT libraries with the JNI_OnLoad initializer. MSBuild automatically copies the libraries for the target Mac architecture into the IKVM runtime image.",
